  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given word is 'ARRANGE'.\r\nIf R's occur together, number of letters in word = 6 \r\nTo arrange R's together number of ways $=\\frac{2 !}{2 !}=1$\r\n$\\therefore$ Number of ways to permuted 'ARRANGE' = $\\frac{6!}{2 !}$",
